author its build files give (mod_author=Luken).

The ping sound (mixins/pingwheel/data/ping.ogg), the arrow texture
(tools/assets/arrow.png, packed into mixins/pingwheel/data/arrow32.rgba by
tools/arrow.mjs), the icon (mixins/pingwheel/data/icon.png) and the English
texts (tools/assets/en_us.json, in mixins/pingwheel/lang.rs) are Ping Wheel's
own (common/src/main/resources/, MIT). The Russian texts
(tools/assets/ru_ru.json) are the port's own: the original has no Russian.

This port, by DeportedToHell, rewrites Ping Wheel's client (the ping key, the
ray, the markers, the direction indicator, the sound, /pingwheel and the
settings screen) and its server side (the relay, channels, rate limit and
/pingwheel:server) in Rust for Horizon's native mod API, speaking the original's
plugin channels byte for byte. It is not affiliated with Luken, Mojang or
Microsoft.
